/* 双模式切换组件样式（与原型 mode-switch 视觉一致，TDesign 语义变量自建） */
@import "../../styles/tokens.wxss";
@import "../../styles/td-variables.wxss";

.mode-switch {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  position: relative;
  margin: 0 auto 35rpx;
  max-width: 519rpx;
  border: 1px solid var(--td-border-color);
  border-radius: 27rpx;
  background: var(--td-bg-color-secondarycontainer);
  overflow: hidden;
}

.mode-option {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 13rpx;
  min-height: 88rpx;
  color: var(--td-text-color-secondary);
  font-size: 25rpx;
  font-weight: 700;
  transition: all var(--motion-normal) var(--ease-standard);
}

/* SVG 图标：对齐原型 mode-switch button svg（17px，stroke currentColor） */
.mode-icon {
  display: block;
  width: 33rpx;
  height: 33rpx;
  fill: none;
  stroke: currentColor;
  stroke-width: 1.7;
  stroke-linecap: round;
  stroke-linejoin: round;
}

.mode-option.mode-active {
  color: var(--td-text-color-primary);
  background: var(--td-brand-color-gradient);
  box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 1px var(--primary-a30);
}
